DESCRIPTION:Fall is here! It's time to clean out your closets\, garage or 
 attic and join our multi-family community-wide yard sale. Plan ahead and r
 eserve your spot at Groce UMC for the fall yard sale on Saturday\, October
  3 from 8 am to 1 pm . This yard sale has become very popular and a succes
 sful community event. Sponsored by the Haw Creek Community Association\, v
 endor/seller spots are $20 (two adjoining spots are $40). R egister online
  to reserve your space (each spot is 9' by 18'). Registration is limited t
 o a total of 56 spots due to space limitations. Free admission and parking
  for shoppers. Hot dogs\, drinks and homemade baked goods for sale to bene
 fit HCCA. Rain or shine event.
LOCATION:Groce UMC for the fall yard sale on Saturday\, October 3 from 8 a
 m to 1 pm
URL:https://hawcreekavl.com/event-6790982
