BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Community Chili Cook Off
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261024T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261024T200000
UID:092b4813ca68f73f11e0f91db8bee30b@hawcreekavl.com
DESCRIPTION:HCCA is sponsoring our third annual chili cook off contest on 
 Saturday\, October 24 . You are invited to participate in one of two ways:
  As a chef entering your own homemade chili or as a judge to help select t
 he winning entries. There will be Chili's Restaurant gift cards for first 
 ($50)\, second ($25) and third ($15) place winners\, based on the favorite
 s selected by the tasting judges\, along with other prizes. Event registra
 tion is requested (select Chef or Tasting Judge). Entry is free! We will b
 e accepting donations and selling baked goods so don't forget to bring a l
 ittle cash with you. There's no better way to spend a fall evening than ea
 ting homemade chili with your neighbors!
LOCATION:Haw Creek\, Asheville\, NC
URL:https://hawcreekavl.com/event-6819208
X-SOURCE:Haw Creek Community Association
